OL,3,GNEWSA'You never know': The people
OL,4,Apreparing for the worst
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat do you keep at the bottom of your
OL,7,Fwardrobe? Winter jumpers? Guest towels?
OL,8,FExtra blankets?
OL,10,FHelen Frayer has a stash of emergency
OL,11,Fsupplies in hers.
OL,13,FTinned vegetables, long-life milk and
OL,14,Fdog food are all secured inside, in
OL,15,Fcase the worst should happen.
OL,17,FLater this year the government is due
OL,18,Fto unveil its strategy on how the
OL,19,Fpublic should better prepare for
OL,20,Femergencies.
